solution:
```java
public static int countEven(int[][] grid) {
    int count = 0;
    for (int r = 0; r < grid.length; r++) {
        for (int c = 0; c < grid[r].length; c++) {
            if (grid[r][c] % 2 == 0) {
                count++;
            }
        }
    }
    return count;
}
```

